  "result": "Fixed in `src/click/core.py`. When a subcommand's context was created, it copied the parent's whole `default_map`. It should have taken only the entry for its own name. So `default_map={\"sub\": {\"name\": \"x\"}}` was looked up as `sub`'s own map, and `--name` never found `x`. It now uses `parent.default_map.get(info_name)`.\n\nI added `test_default_map_subcommand` to `tests/test_defaults.py`, and the full suite passes (1913 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed).",
